# Cloudflare Pages — full route map
#
# Two rule types are used:
#
#   301/302  Redirect  — browser changes URL (for bare/alias paths with no page)
#   200      Rewrite   — serve directory index without trailing-slash redirect
#                        (prevents CF Pages' internal 301 looping)
#
# Execution order (CF Pages):
#   1. _redirects                 — consulted first (no CF Functions in use)
#   2. Static asset serving       — exact-match files (/_astro/*, /Asset/*, etc.)
#   3. /* /Visit/ 200 catch-all   — anything else → Visit dispatch center
#
# Rule ordering (first match wins):
#   1. Bare-path dispatchers (301) — known paths with no page file
#   2. Trailing-slash rewrites (200) — all canonical page paths
#   3. Asset pass-throughs (200)  — before catch-all so assets are never
#                                   swallowed by /* (CF applies _redirects
#                                   before static file serving for 200 rewrites)
#   4. /* catch-all → /Visit/ 200 — universal dispatch for unknown paths
#
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BARE-PATH DISPATCHERS (301)
# These paths have no corresponding page file. [[Path]].ts passes them through
# (no canonical match), then _redirects dispatches to the correct sub-route.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

/Account                  /Account/SignIn           301
/Account/               /Account/SignIn           301
/Legal                    /Legal/Term               301
/Legal/                  /Legal/Term               301
/Contact                  /Contact/Sale             301
/Contact/                /Contact/Sale             301

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# TRAILING-SLASH LOOP PREVENTION (200 rewrites)
# CF Pages would issue a 301 to add a trailing slash for any directory-based
# page (e.g. /Account/SignIn → /Account/SignIn/). The [[Path]].ts function
# strips it back (→ /Account/SignIn), creating an infinite loop.
# 200 rewrites intercept BEFORE CF's trailing-slash logic and serve the
# directory index directly - no redirect, URL stays clean.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Account ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Account/ForgotPassword   /Account/ForgotPassword/  200
/Account/ResetPassword    /Account/ResetPassword/   200
/Account/SignIn           /Account/SignIn/           200
/Account/SignUp           /Account/SignUp/           200

# ── Blog (index + dynamic slug pages) ────────────────────────────────────────
/Blog                     /Blog/                    200
/Blog/*                   /Blog/:splat              200

# ── Contact ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Contact/Sale             /Contact/Sale/            200

# ── Contributing ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Contributing             /Contributing/            200

# ── Dashboard ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Dashboard                /Dashboard/               200

# ── Doc (index + dynamic slug pages) ─────────────────────────────────────────
/Doc                      /Doc/                     200
/Doc/*                    /Doc/:splat               200

# ── Download ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Download                 /Download/                200

# ── Legal ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Legal/Privacy            /Legal/Privacy/           200
/Legal/Term               /Legal/Term/              200

# ── License ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/License                  /License/                 200

# ── OAuth ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/OAuth/Success            /OAuth/Success/           200

# ── Portal ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Portal                   /Portal/                  200

# ── Verify ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/Verify                   /Verify/                  200

# ── Home (root index — must be explicit or /* catches it and loops) ──────────
/                         /                         200

# ── Visit (dispatch center itself) ───────────────────────────────────────────
/Visit                    /Visit/                   200

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# STATIC ASSET PASS-THROUGHS (200 self-rewrites)
# These must appear BEFORE the /* catch-all. CF Pages applies _redirects rules
# before serving static files for 200 proxy rewrites, so without these a
# wildcard /* rule would serve /Visit/index.html for every JS/CSS/image request.
# Each rule maps the path to itself — CF serves the actual file content.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

/_astro/*                 /_astro/:splat            200
/Asset/*                  /Asset/:splat             200
/Favicon/*                /Favicon/:splat           200
/Image/*                  /Image/:splat             200
/RouteMap.json            /RouteMap.json            200
/service-worker.js        /service-worker.js        200
/sitemap-index.xml        /sitemap-index.xml        200
/sitemap-0.xml            /sitemap-0.xml            200
/robots.txt               /robots.txt               200

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# UNIVERSAL CATCH-ALL → Visit dispatch center
#
# Any path that has not been matched by the specific rules above lands here.
# CF Pages serves /Visit/index.html as a 200 rewrite — the browser URL stays
# as the original path. The Visit page's inline script then resolves the path
# against the baked-in route map and issues a window.location.replace() to
# the correct canonical URL, or to / for truly unknown paths.
#
# This rule MUST be last — first match wins and all known routes are above.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

/*                        /Visit/                   200
